          deckDescription: 'Twenty-eight Indonesian dominoes in a double-6 set: each tile has zero to six spots on each end, one of each combination from [0-0] to [6-6]. Spots are typically red; the 1-spot is larger. Same structure as Western double-6 dominoes.',
          suitDescription: 'Domino set has no suits; each tile has two ends with zero to six spots. Tiles are identified by spot pairs (e.g. 3-3, 6-1).',
          rankDescription: 'Double-6 domino rank set: each end has value 0 through 6. Tile value for scoring is the sum of spots; hand value uses the units digit of each two-tile pair (goal is 9).',
